From 1c8883b23d050d991f40976967d21b39e60f165f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: FlysoftBeta <xwnunjyau@outlook.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 03:15:17 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] [cloud_stream] Add CloudStreamController for
 --headless=new

Tracks top-level aura hosts, captures each one with a
FrameSinkVideoCapturer and sends D3D11 textures to the gateway over a
named pipe, forwards cursor changes, drives external BeginFrames and
replaces native file choosers with remote requests. Remote input is
declared in remote_input.h but not implemented yet.
